msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「You don't have to exaggerate......＿Sheesh, you're hopeless. I'm in a good＿mood today, so I'll spend time with you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tienes que exagerar...... Caray, no＿tienes remedio. Hoy estoy de buen humor,＿así que pasaré tiempo contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「You still have holes here and there,＿right? I don't have much time, but I'm＿more than happy to help you fill them.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aún tienes huecos por aquí y por allá,＿¿verdad? No tengo mucho tiempo, pero＿con gusto te ayudo a llenarlos.」"

msgid "Ask her a few things"
msgstr "Preguntarle algunas cosas"

msgid "Don't have much to ask"
msgstr "No tengo mucho que preguntar"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then I guess I'll ask you a few things.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces creo que te preguntaré＿algunas cosas.」"

msgid "Taiga「What's with that nonchalant attitude?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y esa actitud tan indiferente?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「By all means, if you please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por favor, si eres tan amable.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph, you should have said that from＿the start.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum, debiste haber dicho＿eso desde el principio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, I don't have anything to ask in＿particular.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nah, no tengo nada en particular＿que preguntar.」"

msgid "Taiga「I see. In that case, why don't you quit＿standing around and head on home?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo. En ese caso, ¿por qué no dejas＿de perder el tiempo y te vas a casa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about you, Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y tú, Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「I still have some shopping to do, so you＿go on ahead. Bye.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Todavía tengo compras que hacer,＿así que adelántate. Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wow, she really seems to be handling＿herself just fine......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Vaya, de verdad parece que se las＿arregla muy bien sola......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, I'm not lonely or anything!＿Absolutely not!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡No, no me siento solo＿ni nada! ¡Para nada!）」"
